      <p source="#source-465-872"><seg source="#source-465-522">御書拝見仕候。明日西役所え云云の由、早</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-522-555">〻</g><seg source="#source-555-612">参上の筈ニ候得ども、蒸気船借入且手銃千</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-615-660"><seg source="#source-612-615">廷</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-636-645">（挺）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-660-678">取入申候て早</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-678-711">〻</g><seg source="#source-711-872">出帆と決心仕候ニ付、通弁者其外、人数をそろへ異館へ参候所ナリ。今宵彼方より帰次第御旅宿まで参上仕候。謹言。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-872-901" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-893-901"><seg source="#source-893-901">六日</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-901-963" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-922-963"><seg source="#source-922-937">佐々木先生</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-937-963" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-955-963">楳拝</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-963-990" style="padding-inline-start: 6em">
        <p source="#source-984-990"><seg source="#source-984-990">左右</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
